    dct:description "k_loc^2 = -<u Delta u>/<u^2> over the whole ellipsoid surface of the relaxed generalized Swift-Hohenberg field at GW38 (eps=0.500, g2=0.356, mean edge 1.89 mm, 320 semi-implicit steps)" ;
    dct:source "Richman et al. (1975) Science Eq. 1 lambda = 2*pi*h*(mu_c/3mu_s)^(1/3) at h = 2.60 mm (11.34 mm observed, Tallinen 2016)" ;
    rdfs:comment "k_c is imposed by the GSH operator, so this is a consistency check of the nonlinear planform (no wavelength locking / coarsening), not an independent validation" ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy "script" ;
    schema:about "Mammalian cerebral cortex & subcortical white matter (Homo sapiens, Pan troglodytes, Macaca mulatta, Tursiops truncatus, Felis catus, Mus musculus)" ;
    schema:error 7.487e-01 ;
    schema:targetValue 1.13269e+01 ;
    schema:unitText "mm" ;
    schema:value 1.14117e+01 .

