    dct:source "Zilles et al. (1988) Anat. Embryol. 179:173-179 (human GI 2.56 +/- 0.08); Tallinen et al. (2016) Nature Physics area-based GI" ;
    rdfs:comment "Depth amplitude is NOT emergent in the GSH surrogate (imported from the 2D shell); only the fundus length is emergent" ;
