    dct:source "Upper bound: trivalent honeycomb network vertex density 4/(sqrt(3) lambda^2) = 2.3094 per lambda^2 (derivation in surface_sh_3d_reference.json); Stoop et al. (2015) Nature Materials labyrinth phase" ;
