<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-1> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Tallinen et al. (2014) Multiplicative Cortical Growth Decomposition & Critical Buckling Threshold" ;
    dct:description "Establishes the multiplicative growth decomposition of tangential cortical expansion relative to the subcortical white-matter core and the critical threshold separating lissencephaly (g <= g_c) from gyrencephaly (g > g_c) | Variables: F: total deformation gradient; F_e: elastic deformation gradient; G: tangential cortical growth tensor with linear factor g; g_c = 1.18: critical sulcal creasing threshold" ;
    dct:source "Tallinen et al. (2014) PNAS 111:12667-12672 Eq. (1) & Fig. 1-2; Tallinen et al. (2016) Nature Physics 12:588-593" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/1975-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling.py#L162-L169>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_061_cortical_gyrification_folding.lean#L25-L35> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def cortical_growth_excess (g g_c : Int) : Int :=
  g - g_c
theorem tallinen_critical_growth_threshold (g_c : Int) :
    cortical_growth_excess g_c g_c = 0 ∧
    ∀ dg : Nat, cortical_growth_excess (g_c + Int.ofNat (dg + 1)) g_c = Int.ofNat (dg + 1)
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "F = F_e G,  G = diag(g, 1);  Δg = g - g_c = 0 ⇔ g = g_c (lissencephalic threshold)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00304699>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nmat4202>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nphys3632>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1406015111>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.200033797>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/RevModPhys.65.851>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1145181>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.aaa9101> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Neo-Hookean Multiplicative Cortical Growth & Elastic Subcortical Buckling / Sulcal Creasing" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_061.cortical_growth_excess" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_061.tallinen_critical_growth_threshold" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-2> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Richman et al. (1975) & Tallinen et al. (2014) Cube-Law Sulcal Wavelength Scaling" ;
    dct:description "Predicts linear scaling of gyral/sulcal wavelength with cortical thickness h and cube-root scaling with cortical-to-subcortical stiffness ratio across normal, polymicrogyric, and comparative mammalian brains | Variables: λ: sulcal folding wavelength (mm); h: cortical gray-matter thickness (mm); μ_c: cortical shear modulus (kPa); μ_s: subcortical white-matter shear modulus (kPa)" ;
    dct:source "Richman et al. (1975) Science 189:18-21 Eq. (1) & Table 1; Tallinen et al. (2014) PNAS 111:12667-12672 Fig. 3-4" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/1975-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling.py#L172-L178>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_061_cortical_gyrification_folding.lean#L51-L59> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def richman_wavelength_residual (lam h mu_c mu_s : Int) : Int :=
  3 * mu_s * (lam * lam * lam) - 2 * mu_c * (h * h * h)
theorem richman_cube_law_wavelength_stationarity (h mu_s : Int) :
    richman_wavelength_residual h h (3 * mu_s) (2 * mu_s) = 0 ∧
    richman_wavelength_residual (2 * h) h (24 * mu_s) (2 * mu_s) = 0
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "U_tot(λ) ~ μ_c h^3 / λ^2 + 3 μ_s λ  ⇒  ∂U_tot/∂λ = 0  ⇔  λ = 2π h (μ_c / (3 μ_s))^(1/3)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00304699>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nmat4202>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nphys3632>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1406015111>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.200033797>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/RevModPhys.65.851>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1145181>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.aaa9101> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Neo-Hookean Multiplicative Cortical Growth & Elastic Subcortical Buckling / Sulcal Creasing" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_061.richman_wavelength_residual" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_061.richman_cube_law_wavelength_stationarity" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-3> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Zilles et al. (1988) & Tallinen et al. (2016) Gyrification Index Buried Sulcal Perimeter Law" ;
    dct:description "Quantifies the ratio of total pial surface contour to outer convex hull perimeter across human fetal gestation (GW22-GW38) and across 11 mammalian species | Variables: GI: coronal gyrification index; P_pial: total pial contour perimeter (mm); P_hull: outer convex hull perimeter (mm); N_sulci: number of sulcal infoldings; d_sulcus: mean sulcal depth (mm)" ;
    dct:source "Zilles et al. (1988) Anat. Embryol. 179:173-179; Tallinen et al. (2016) Nature Physics 12:588-593 Fig. 3-4" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/1975-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling.py#L181-L189>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_061_cortical_gyrification_folding.lean#L74-L83> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def gyrification_perimeter_excess (P_hull n_sulci d_sulcus : Int) : Int :=
  (P_hull + 2 * n_sulci * d_sulcus) - P_hull
theorem gyrification_index_sulcal_excess (P_hull n_sulci d_sulcus : Int) :
    gyrification_perimeter_excess P_hull 0 d_sulcus = 0 ∧
    gyrification_perimeter_excess P_hull n_sulci d_sulcus = 2 * n_sulci * d_sulcus
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "GI = P_pial / P_hull = 1 + (2 N_sulci d_sulcus) / P_hull ≥ 1.0  (GI = 1.0 ⇔ N_sulci = 0)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00304699>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nmat4202>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nphys3632>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1406015111>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.200033797>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/RevModPhys.65.851>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1145181>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.aaa9101> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Neo-Hookean Multiplicative Cortical Growth & Elastic Subcortical Buckling / Sulcal Creasing" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_061.gyrification_perimeter_excess" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_061.gyrification_index_sulcal_excess" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-4> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "(Pass 3) Generalized Swift-Hohenberg Film-on-Curved-Substrate Linear Mode Selection (Stoop et al. 2015)" ;
    dct:description "Reduced 3D surface model replacing the requested volumetric FEM: selects the Richman wavelength on the curved hemisphere, produces the Stoop hexagonal-dimple (low ε) → labyrinth with Y-junctions (high ε) transition across GW26 → GW38, and damps the uniform mode | Variables: u: inward normal buckling amplitude on the hemisphere surface; ε = ε₀ (g − g_c)/(g_GW38 − g_c): dimensionless overstress from the growth excess; k_c(x) = 2π/λ(h(x)): locally preferred wavenumber; g₂ ∝ h/R: curvature-induced quadratic coefficient (dimple-favouring); Δ: cotangent Laplace-Beltrami operator on the ellipsoid" ;
    dct:source "Stoop N, Lagrange R, Terwagne D, Reis PM, Dunkel J (2015) Nature Materials 14:337-342 Eq. (1); Cross MC, Hohenberg PC (1993) Rev. Mod. Phys. 65:851" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/1975-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling.py#L515-L576>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_061_cortical_gyrification_folding.lean#L99-L113> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def sh_growth_rate (eps kc2 k2 : Int) : Int :=
  eps - (kc2 - k2) * (kc2 - k2)
theorem swift_hohenberg_fastest_mode (eps kc2 : Int) :
    sh_growth_rate eps kc2 kc2 = eps ∧
    (∀ k2 : Int, sh_growth_rate eps kc2 k2 ≤ eps) ∧
    sh_growth_rate eps kc2 0 = eps - kc2 * kc2
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "∂ₜu = ε u − (1 + Δ/k_c(x)²)² u + g₂ u² − u³;  σ(k) = ε − (1 − k²/k_c²)²,  argmax_k σ = k_c,  σ(0) = ε − 1 < 0" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00304699>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nmat4202>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nphys3632>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1406015111>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.200033797>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/RevModPhys.65.851>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1145181>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.aaa9101> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Neo-Hookean Multiplicative Cortical Growth & Elastic Subcortical Buckling / Sulcal Creasing" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_061.sh_growth_rate" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_061.swift_hohenberg_fastest_mode" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-5> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "(Pass 3) Regional Cortical-Thickness Gradient ⇒ Regional Sulcal Wavelength Ratio" ;
    dct:description "Applies the Richman cube law locally to a regional thickness gradient and tests that the nonlinear 3D planform adapts its wavelength regionally (no locking): emergent slope 1.006, r = 1.0000 over the 4-point sweep | Variables: h₀ = 2.60 mm: mean cortical thickness; β ∈ {0, 0.1, 0.2, 0.3}: anterior-posterior gradient (β = 0.3 spans 2.08-3.12 mm, inside the Fischl & Dale 2000 regional range); x/a ∈ [-1, 1]: normalised AP coordinate; λ_ant, λ_post: emergent wavelengths in the anterior / posterior thirds" ;
    dct:source "Richman et al. (1975) Science 189:18-21 Eq. (1); Fischl B, Dale AM (2000) PNAS 97:11050-11055 (regional thickness range)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/1975-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling.py#L760-L802>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_061_cortical_gyrification_folding.lean#L128-L137> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def local_wavelength (C h : Int) : Int :=
  C * h
theorem regional_wavelength_tracks_thickness (C h_ant h_post h0 d b : Int) :
    local_wavelength C h_ant * h_post = local_wavelength C h_post * h_ant ∧
    local_wavelength C (h0 * (d + b)) * (d - b) =
      local_wavelength C (h0 * (d - b)) * (d + b)
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "h(x) = h₀ (1 + β x/a);  λ(x) = 2π h(x) (μ_c/3μ_s)^{1/3};  λ_ant/λ_post = h_ant/h_post = (1+β)/(1−β)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00304699>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nmat4202>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nphys3632>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1406015111>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.200033797>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/RevModPhys.65.851>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1145181>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.aaa9101> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Neo-Hookean Multiplicative Cortical Growth & Elastic Subcortical Buckling / Sulcal Creasing" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_061.local_wavelength" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_061.regional_wavelength_tracks_thickness" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling-6> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "(Pass 3) 3D Crease-Wall Gyrification Index (Law 3 lifted from coronal perimeter to hemispheric area)" ;
    dct:description "Computes the 3D gyrification index of the hemispheric planform (GW38: 2.60 vs 2.56 observed) with only the fundus length emergent; the smooth displaced-surface area ratio is reported as a lower bound | Variables: A_hull: ellipsoid hull area (mm²); L_zero: emergent u = 0 iso-contour length (marching triangles, mm) = 2 L_fundus; d̄: mean sulcal depth (mm) imported from the 2D coronal solver of the same stage; GI_3D: area-based gyrification index" ;
    dct:source "Zilles et al. (1988) Anat. Embryol. 179:173-179; Tallinen et al. (2016) Nature Physics 12:588-593 (area-based GI)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/1975-richman-cortical-gyrification-buckling.py#L691-L714>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45670cb8/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_061_cortical_gyrification_folding.lean#L150-L159> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def gyrification_area_excess (A_hull L_f d : Int) : Int :=
  (A_hull + 2 * L_f * d) - A_hull
theorem gyrification_index_3d_crease_wall (A_hull L_f d : Int) :
    gyrification_area_excess A_hull 0 d = 0 ∧
    gyrification_area_excess A_hull L_f d = (2 * L_f) * d
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "A_pial = A_hull + 2 L_fundus d̄ = A_hull + L_zero d̄;  GI_3D = A_pial/A_hull = 1 + L_zero d̄ / A_hull ≥ 1  (GI_3D = 1 ⇔ L_fundus = 0)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00304699>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nmat4202>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nphys3632>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.1406015111>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.200033797>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/RevModPhys.65.851>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1145181>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.aaa9101> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Neo-Hookean Multiplicative Cortical Growth & Elastic Subcortical Buckling / Sulcal Creasing" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_061.gyrification_area_excess" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_061.gyrification_index_3d_crease_wall" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

